WEBVTT

00:11:58.756 --> 00:12:01.550
No one have the right
to touch my boob, no."

00:12:01.925 --> 00:12:03.719
And they're adamant.

00:12:04.303 --> 00:12:09.183
I mean, the joy at taking that
is that finally,

00:12:09.183 --> 00:12:11.894
you can speak up with no danger.

00:12:11.894 --> 00:12:13.395
With no fear.

00:12:13.854 --> 00:12:17.024
I mean, empowering people to that point

00:12:17.065 --> 00:12:18.192
makes me more humble.

00:12:18.233 --> 00:12:20.402
I don't even know, sometimes I'm like,

00:12:20.444 --> 00:12:23.197
"Where is the hole that I can drive in
and then disappear,

00:12:23.197 --> 00:12:24.656
and let them be."

00:12:25.032 --> 00:12:26.325
But they won't let me go.

00:12:26.325 --> 00:12:28.368
They say, "We want you
to come and see us,

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.787
and then we learn from you."

00:12:29.828 --> 00:12:33.916
But I learn more from those girls
than I can ever learn from anybody.